            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for kind words and an interesting debugging problem.\r\n\r\nI am able to reproduce this but only in development version of Neovim (`NVIM v0.9.0-dev-109-g0b71960ab` in my case). Neovim 0.8.0 release works fine. This indeed happens because `MiniStarter.refresh()` is called on `VimResized` event.\r\n\r\nNot yet sure what caused this, but my initial feeling is that the problem is on Neovim side. I'll look into it.   ",
