            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am positive that this is a result of neovim/neovim#20759.\r\n\r\nIf it bothers you too much, you can replace [these lines](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3202e7a298f4fe7513b4dad409075e6b618488f9/lua/mini/starter.lua#L1271) with this:\r\n```\r\nau VimResized <buffer=%s> lua vim.schedule(MiniStarter.refresh)\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'll wait to see how Neovim issue is resolved. If it won't be fixed, I'll update 'mini.starter' to echo in scheduled manner.",
